# Key concepts {% #key-concepts %}

{% cards %}
{% cards_item href="/docs/products/databases/vectorsdb/databases" title="Databases" %}
Create and manage vector databases, the largest organizational unit.
{% /cards_item %}
{% cards_item href="/docs/products/databases/vectorsdb/collections" title="Collections" %}
Created with a required `dimension`, the length of the vectors they hold, plus an optional `metadata` object per document.
{% /cards_item %}
{% cards_item href="/docs/products/databases/vectorsdb/documents" title="Documents" %}
Store one embedding under `embeddings` and any associated JSON under `metadata`.
{% /cards_item %}
{% cards_item href="/docs/products/databases/vectorsdb/embeddings" title="Embeddings" %}
Generate embeddings from text with built-in models, without a separate embedding service.
{% /cards_item %}
{% cards_item href="/docs/products/databases/vectorsdb/permissions" title="Permissions" %}
Control access at the collection and document level.
{% /cards_item %}
{% cards_item href="/docs/products/databases/vectorsdb/queries" title="Queries" %}
Filter documents by their `metadata` with comparison, string, and logical operators.
{% /cards_item %}
{% cards_item href="/docs/products/databases/vectorsdb/order" title="Order" %}
Sort results by metadata fields.
{% /cards_item %}
{% cards_item href="/docs/products/databases/vectorsdb/backups" title="Backups" %}
Schedule backup policies and restore from any backup.
{% /cards_item %}
